ndfather!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Party Game Mode:</strong> Versus fun! 2 to 4 players in a score attack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Mode:</strong>\u00a0Complete the lines in the tower to get more oxygen and keep playing!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy, Accessible, Fun Gameplay:</strong> great for all ages, from grandkids to grandparents!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1522300/extras/4e0964e40df198bca023759a509ed616.avif?t=1740081911\" width=200 height=274 /></span></p>","developers":["Flux Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1522300/header.jpg?t=1740081911","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1522300/831738/aee95ce0194e917cee0dfcdd2e28301487859485/1750998571/dash_av1.mpd?t=1740081908","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1522300/831738/aee95ce0194e917cee0dfcdd2e28301487859485/1750998571/dash_h264.mpd?t=1740081908","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1522300/831738/aee95ce0194e917cee0dfcdd2e28301487859485/1750998571/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1740081908","id":257100025,"name":"CozyBlock_Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257100025/49daddc6839ea3f3cc7ccbe3c8a5bf4315f1faf6/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740081908"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1522300/372250/27dd304fdb447bfbaf3bb70f0638d2fd4f31a4fe/1750998597/dash_av1.mpd?t=1621982206","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto